WEBVTT

00:11:29.184 --> 00:11:31.854
and to do that inspiration at scale.

00:11:32.271 --> 00:11:34.523
And at the same time,

00:11:34.565 --> 00:11:38.193
we are helping to drive down
the cost of higher education

00:11:38.193 --> 00:11:42.656
by still providing the personal support
at the time that it's needed.

00:11:44.241 --> 00:11:47.327
So I began this talk
talking about my father.

00:11:48.620 --> 00:11:51.206
There's a lot that has changed
about higher education

00:11:51.248 --> 00:11:52.666
over this period of time,

00:11:52.708 --> 00:11:55.043
and there are things
that have not changed.

00:11:56.170 --> 00:11:58.088
We, as institutions,

00:11:58.088 --> 00:12:03.469
still find ourselves
being exclusive and expensive,